{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_51_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"一、二十有二年，春，王正月，肆大眚。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"肆，失也。眚，災也。災紀也，失故也。為嫌天子之葬也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"二、癸丑，葬我小君文姜。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"小君，非君也。其曰君何也？以其為公配，可以言小君也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"三、陳人殺其公子御寇。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"言公子而不言大夫，公子未命為大夫也。其曰公子何也？公子之重視大夫，命以執公子。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"四、夏，五月。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，丙申，及齊高傒盟於防。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"不言公，高傒伉也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"六、冬，公如齊納幣。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_51_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_51","textTraditional":"納幣，大夫之事也。禮有納采，有問名，有納徵，有告期。四者備，而後娶，禮也。公之親納幣，非禮也，故譏之。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}